27	//	line 2: a blank line (no output, but it keeps its physical line number)
28	//	line 3: a field-invalid log (failure result with a reason)
29	//
30	// trailingFragment is a complete, field-valid JSON object WITHOUT a trailing
31	// newline: at a clean EOF it is the final complete log; under a read fault it
32	// is a fragment of the failed read.
33	func mixedCompleteLinesAndFragment() (complete, fragment string) {
